{"detail": {"templateUuid": "fad0659d9a0c4005a49840fd89aab9e7", "projectUuid": "18359f00b3f94bd2b7b7bec4150115b1", "name": "自然随时控制人类", "description": "用 3 天下班挤出来的 13 个小时，拍了 5 分钟完整 AI 短片，卡着@NoSleepChild失眠少年乐队 的《自然随时控制人类》音乐\n\n人物采样带着私心用了自己，为了符合镜头角色半裸上阵。故事本是剥离了所有科技伪装、困在死亡循环里，最终要直面自我与自然法则的人。就是最直白的、人类在欲望与宿命里的挣扎。做的时候反复调整光影，克服了好久的抽卡镜头焦虑。\n片子的内核，是我藏了很久的执念：人类妄图用 AI 与基因改造僭越自然，被科技反噬，最终被自然重构，完成人与科技、与自然的共生。从美式地铁站的无尽死亡循环，到榕树吞噬 AI 服务器的反噬，再到最终飞向宇宙的星舰编队，融合了《湮灭》的有机无机共生感，还有《普罗米修斯》里对宇宙与宿命的追问，不是空有画面的爽片，每一个镜头，都藏着我对这首歌、这个命题的所有理解。", "coverUrl": "/assets/985fa2029fadba21.webp", "finalOutput": "https://libtv-res.liblib.art/upload-images/017cfebe38424ac0801d8cd00d970039/5bdfd8d2b246c6f81552b69f7a09aca718a2fee3.mp4", "snapshotId": 3673, "auditStatus": 1, "ownerId": 83727, "ownerUuid": "017cfebe38424ac0801d8cd00d970039", "avatar": "/assets/6eca643a31c556bc.webp", "nickname": "fly飛仔", "isLike": false, "likeCount": 125, "tags": [{"id": 1204, "code": "mv", "tagLabel": "MV", "parentTag": 1200, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1200/1204/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 4, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}, {"id": 3021, "code": "test", "tagLabel": "AI影像狂飙季", "parentTag": 0, "categoryId": 0, "path": "3021/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 10, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 5}, {"id": 3023, "code": "test", "tagLabel": "创意单元", "parentTag": 3021, "categoryId": 0, "path": "3021/3023", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 10, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 5}, {"id": 1202, "code": "style_aesthetic", "tagLabel": "风格美学", "parentTag": 1200, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1200/1202/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 2, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}], "userTags": [{"tagId": 5002, "name": "专业", "icon": "/assets/a31a6cc391430f72.webp", "primaryIcon": "/assets/7097b07d2df12cc8.webp", "desc": "LibTV专业作者", "verifyLevel": 2}], "score": 0, "socialMediaUrl": "http://xhslink.com/o/1gR3l5t2oBA", "createAt": "2026年04月08日 00:23", "updateAt": "2026年05月08日 22:38", "publishAt": "2026年04月08日 00:23", "